Error [jet.ReturnTypeMismatch]: This value is Int (a whole number), but this lambda returns U8
  --> tests/ui/E0113_int_narrowing_lambda_return.jet:4:25
    |
  4 |     print(apply(fn(n) { n * 2 }, 5))
    |                         ^^^^^
 Why: This lambda's result is U8, so the value it hands back must be U8
 Fix: Convert it with `checked(U8{value}) ?? fallback`; the conversion is `None` when the value doesn't fit in U8
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113
